WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:41.430
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:47.500
<i>Taichi Yagami and the Chosen Ones
with their partner Digimon</i>

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:50.360
<i>continue their adventure.</i>

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:54.340
<i>On a continent
where only the strong survive,</i>

00:01:54.340 --> 00:02:00.620
<i>Taichi and Agumon are plunged into a war
against ravaging, carnivorous Digimon.</i>

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:06.140
<i>Surviving the verge of death
and surpassing their limit,</i>

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:11.540
<i>the two finally activated on their own
the awakening evolution of the unknown.</i>

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:25.770
Wargreymon...

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:30.270
I can feel overflowing power.

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:32.560
Taichi!

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:34.880
I'm glad you two were safe.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:37.990
What an amazing evolution!
How did you guys do it?

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:42.720
Uh, it's just that we were frantic, so...

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:44.390
What is it?

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:45.490
I don't know.

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:49.720
Is something wrong?

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:51.920
This one has suddenly...

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:55.590
Wargreymon...

00:02:56.090 --> 00:03:02.840
Your awakening and your powers
have called back my ancient memories.

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:13.270
A NEW DARKNESS, MILLENNIUMON

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.280
Who are you?

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:28.410
Lopmon.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:31.830
But that is my name in this life.

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:38.630
I am the remnant of the Digimon who led
the Army of Light in the ancient war.

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:42.180
The ancient war...

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:55.360
Wargreymon and the Chosen Ones...

00:03:55.860 --> 00:04:00.900
Your fearless, bright courage to fight
is what lit the path to a great evolution,

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:07.160
letting you reach the existence beyond
an Ultimate Digimon, a Mega Digimon.

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.520
Agumon!

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:14.080
Are you okay?

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:18.380
I'm hungry...

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:23.800
Wow, thanks!

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:26.930
Your evolutions...

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:32.560
are a miraculous skill made possible
by the bond with the Chosen Ones.

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:37.770
Due to such great power,
that form cannot be sustained for long.

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:44.950
The black lightning...

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:48.120
The sign of a new darkness...

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.450
A new darkness...

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:55.770
<i>We heard a mysterious voice
at the temple on Cloud Continent.</i>

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:59.650
<i>We heard a story from a Digimon
with shining wings.</i>

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:05.900
That there was a war between light
and darkness in the ancient Digital World

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:08.320
and both sides had perished.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:12.450
But now, a new darkness
is about to be born.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:17.600
And the only ones who could stop that
are us and our partner Digimon.

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:21.960
So you have already received
Valdurmon's guidance.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:27.360
That one had also been a great Digimon
who led the Army of Light along with me.

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:32.220
One of our keystones in the past war,

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:37.120
Wargreymon's appearance
and the awakening of my memories.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:41.130
Darkness will not overlook this matter.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:58.980
As expected, we must escape this area
as soon as possible.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:10.260
Wow...

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:11.530
They moved!

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:17.330
What are those?

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:20.790
They are here.

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:23.590
Something's there!

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:27.230
What? Ghosts?

00:06:27.230 --> 00:06:29.760
Wrong, those are Bakemon.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.760
BAKEMON

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:33.100
Get back!

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:48.170
Do not underestimate them. They are
the frontline troops of the new darkness.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:50.630
Then they're targeting you, Lopmon?!

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:53.910
Correct. Of course,
the same applies to you as well.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:03.860
Baby Flame!

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:05.550
Magical Fire!

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.760
Petit Twister!

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:15.070
Chosen Ones, move forward for now.

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:16.680
Follow me.

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:20.810
What if they come after us?

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:32.260
Isn't this...

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:36.370
I am sending my memories
to your consciousness.

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:44.520
Yeah, this is that scene!

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:47.380
The past war that we saw
on Cloud Continent.

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:51.780
The previous war between us and darkness

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:56.530
took place in the skies
and lands, the entire Digital World.

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:56.390
CHERUBIMON

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:57.890
An evolution...

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:02.410
I am one of the Mega Digimon
who led the Army of Light,

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:05.270
the existence known as Cherubimon.

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:18.100
That's...

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:22.100
The Digimon described
as the ultimate weapon born of darkness.

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:25.330
The name is Millenniumon.

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:25.330
MILLENNIUMON

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:35.280
Millenniumon destroyed everything in sight

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:38.220
with a power beyond
the Army of Darkness's control.

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:41.060
Thus, we...

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:46.500
Angemon?

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:47.730
And...

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:03.500
They evolved!

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:14.920
After sacrificing all,
we defeated Millenniumon.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:24.540
However, complete elimination
was not possible.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.540
And remnant shards rained down
on Cloud Continent

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:31.190
as well as this Eternal Continent.

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:48.670
The black lightning
that began to strike this land...

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:54.510
<i>That is the energy from the human world
which the darkness desires.</i>

00:09:56.420 --> 00:10:01.830
<i>The ominous dark glow
that continues to spread by the day</i>

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:04.600
<i>becomes this Eternal Continent's fuel.</i>

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:07.940
<i>It will be eternally fueled, stored,</i>

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:14.090
<i>and it is about to change Millenniumon's
shards sleeping within the land.</i>

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:17.380
Is that Millenniumon going to come back?!

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:21.590
I sense an even stronger,
more violent movement.

00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:23.950
That is the new darkness.

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:29.480
I no longer hold any power,
but I do possess hope!

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:31.480
That is you, the Chosen Ones,

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:36.510
and the awakening of the Mega Evolutions
of the warriors who fight beside you.

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:42.320
When Digimon end their lives
and are reborn elsewhere,

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:47.230
their previous memories disappear into
the depths of their souls and are lost.

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:52.290
The awakening of my ancient memories
is normally impossible as well.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:55.360
It is a miracle caused by
the glow of your evolutions.

00:10:56.190 --> 00:11:00.090
You should be able to shine
with the Holy Digimon's powers

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:02.910
and do away with darkness.

00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:06.120
Taichi, what's wrong?

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:13.040
Hey, Lopmon,
could the Holy Digimon possibly...

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:21.760
Here they come again!

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:23.410
Agumon!

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:26.100
Agumon Evolution!

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:29.040
Greymon!

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:30.390
Mega Flame!

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:33.920
Piyomon, let's go!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:36.570
Piyomon Evolution!

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:38.900
Birdramon!

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:50.710
A new enemy is coming, let us hurry!

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:08.470
Please give me a moment.
There is a way to save you all here.

00:12:18.440 --> 00:12:20.490
METALFANTOMON

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:22.380
That's...

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:26.050
Metalfantomon,
the Digimon that evolves from Bakemon!

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:27.510
An Ultimate Digimon!

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:29.510
Let's go, Greymon!

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:30.370
Yeah!

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.380
Mega Flame!

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:53.230
You're fighting us!

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:03.530
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:06.160
Metalgreymon!

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:16.310
Here we go, Birdramon!

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:17.420
All right!

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:23.670
What?!

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:27.780
I'm charging through, Sora!

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:28.680
Okay!

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:35.690
Respond to my voice
and rise from your long slumber!

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:45.510
I see now...

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:50.600
The Digimon are causing
the satellite programs to slowly change.

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:55.230
You've been mumbling for a while,
but what are you doing?

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:56.270
Right now,

00:13:56.270 --> 00:14:01.090
I'm speculating the outcome of the issues
at the International Space Station.

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:06.150
According to my data, there's trouble
occurring on all satellites in orbit.

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:08.340
It hasn't made the news yet though.

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:10.990
So we're the only ones who know?

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:15.740
<i>Weather, communication, all satellites
worldwide are losing control</i>

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:19.560
<i>and they're starting to deviate
from their orbital paths.</i>

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:22.610
The thruster's no good, we can't maneuver!

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:27.360
Not only artificial satellites,
but there are responses of space debris!

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:30.720
Why would space garbage move?!

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:35.450
At the end of all their paths is ISS,
the International Space Station.

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:40.230
If they all collide, they'll become
a large mass like a meteor!

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:42.230
And what'll happen to it?

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:46.630
In my estimate,
this mass will fall towards Earth.

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:50.400
The surface may burn up from friction,

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:53.160
but even what's left
will be a phenomenal amount.

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:57.390
If that crashes into Earth,
the effects would be immeasurable!

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:01.120
What's the matter?!

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:03.020
The estimated crash point is...

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:05.020
Tokyo again!

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:08.950
The range of damage estimated
at the time of crash would be...

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:11.160
Oh no!

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:17.180
Shoot, Metalgreymon!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:19.330
Giga Storm!

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:24.350
Not over yet!

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:25.170
Yeah.

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:39.640
GOKUMON

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:41.390
Another evolution!

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:51.900
Gokumon... a Mega Digimon!

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:56.280
Good, they followed us!

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:01.060
Lure them a little more...

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:02.330
And now!

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:15.620
Birdramon!

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.100
Save everyone!

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:20.330
Yes, I swear I'll protect them!

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:24.020
Birdramon Super Evolution!

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:26.440
Garudamon!

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:34.860
Shadow Wing!

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:56.110
Garudamon!

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:57.030
Yeah!

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:21.180
We're fine, we can still fight!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:22.500
Yeah...

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:30.380
Giga Storm!

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:38.590
Could this be...

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:42.890
We won't let you...

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:45.140
Pass beyond here!

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:58.910
Metalgreymon Mega Evolution!

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:15.420
Wargreymon!

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:53.460
Gaia Force!

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:07.480
Taichi!

00:19:08.770 --> 00:19:10.960
We did it, Taichi.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.060
Yeah...

00:19:21.530 --> 00:19:25.990
The way to save everyone is these Digimon?

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:29.750
Komondomon, long time no see!

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:30.750
KOMONDOMON

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:35.900
In the days of the past war,
the Komondomon were our friends

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:39.530
who saved the weak
and dashed across the lands.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:41.930
Nice to meet you, Komondomon!

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:49.890
I cannot leave the Woodmon
who've taken care of me.

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:53.150
I will guide them to a safe place.

00:19:54.480 --> 00:19:55.610
Lopmon.

00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:57.150
Tell me.

00:19:57.480 --> 00:20:01.800
Is there another Holy Digimon
besides Angemon?

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.050
Indeed.

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:06.410
The ones who once became the key
to defeat Millenniumon...

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:11.600
The Holy Digimon is the name that points
to the two souls who are a pair.

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:12.850
What?!

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:14.690
I didn't know that...

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:19.880
Then that means there's someone else
like Takeru-kun, another one of us.

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:22.680
Is it Hikari?

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:28.430
If that child has been
summoned to this world,

00:20:28.930 --> 00:20:31.310
then it must be so.

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:36.210
Komondomon,

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:40.480
go rescue Digimon
who desire peace like the Woodmon!

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:48.590
There are eight Chosen Ones,

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:53.230
six warriors paired to the children,
and two Holy Digimon.

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:57.080
Find them all including the remaining
Holy Digimon at once!

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.650
I'm gonna take back Hikari
from Skullknightmon.

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:06.240
And I'm going to find that Holy Digimon!

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:08.850
Yeah! Let's work hard, Taichi!

00:21:09.560 --> 00:21:14.160
That will also lead to
solving the problems in our world.

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:16.620
Let's hurry and meet everyone!

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:17.610
Yeah!

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:29.030
Someone's there...

00:22:31.010 --> 00:22:32.680
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:35.700
<i>Wargreymon.</i>

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:38.700
<i>This Digimon mega evolves
from Metalgreymon.</i>

00:22:35.810 --> 00:22:38.700
LEVEL: MEGA

00:22:38.700 --> 00:22:41.000
TYPE: DRAGON-MAN

00:22:38.700 --> 00:22:43.340
<i>Wargreymon's the ultimate dragon warrior
that only a true hero can reach!</i>

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:43.190
SPECIAL MOVE: GAIA FORCE

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:45.790
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.790 --> 00:22:46.800
<i>Agumon?</i>

00:22:46.800 --> 00:22:51.430
<i>I became Wargreymon
and now I've got my big boy pants on!</i>

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:53.590
<i>My armor's heavy, but I'll do my best!</i>

00:22:53.590 --> 00:22:54.950
<i>You look awesome!</i>

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:07.990
<i>The little hero Takeru and Patamon
dash through the great plains!</i>

00:23:07.990 --> 00:23:11.740
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"Soaring Hope"</i>

00:23:11.740 --> 00:23:14.600
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
